    description: "Surfaced when a WI-zufij PR CI ran the full core package (0 source files changed) and hit a cold catalog cache. Fix: warm all_known_languages() before the mock. Only test_cli_config.py mocks safe_load (contained)."  # 82df
    fields:  # 82df
      statement: "A test that mocks yaml.safe_load to raise on the Nth call while driving cmd_config must be independent of catalog-cache warmth (warm all_known_languages before installing the mock)."  # 82df
      root_cause: "cmd_config() validates args.language via all_known_languages(), which cold-loads 4 catalog YAMLs through yaml.safe_load on first use (module-cached after). test_yaml_parse_error_degrades_gracefully raises on the FIRST safe_load call assuming it is cmd_config's dataflow_patterns load; a COLD catalog cache (test-ordering/sharding dependent) consumes the raising call with a catalog load, so dataflow_patterns loads successfully and 'is None' fails. Deterministic in isolation."  # 82df
